lines+=['','Frankenmermaid’s range is not a measured zero. The full original test execution completed, but0.6 changed205 of1,087 native models relative to reviewed0.5, including new Kanban and sequence metadata. The old view/absence review cannot safely score it. [Version review and raw model comparisons](model-review/REVIEW.md).','','ZM5.18’s existing bound models were reviewed:1,083/1,087 ordered native observations match5.17; four Git models add an unused `config.useMaxWidth`. Native declarations retain the fields/encodings read by existing views. Six newly exported parser families lack bindings; their old family-table absence confirmation is withheld, so they remain unknown with no pass credit. Raw runs and initial fully unreviewed scores are retained; only the standard Trident re-scoring helper was used.','','## Full rendering completion and time','','Completed counts below use the1,338 reference-accepted inputs. The median total time covers all1,342 attempts. Three fresh repetitions after warm-up; raw ranges and every failure remain in each arm’s `dave-report.json`. Different completion counts are unequal work, so these totals do not establish equal-work speed ratios. Browser SVG is an awaited, consumed SVG boundary; it is not the complete Node receipt boundary below. PNG here is Trident’s SVG-to-canvas conversion for every row. Franken terminal includes fresh native process startup; the other terminal rows are persistent Node API calls.','','| Configuration | SVG completed | SVG s | PNG completed | PNG s | Terminal completed | Terminal s |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
