lines+=['','PR versus main: all63 common assessed crossings agree (three total), all63 assessed edge/node collision counts agree (zero), all60 assessed label-overlap counts agree (zero), and all55 assessed edge/label counts agree (zero), in both default and balanced modes. No structure verdict changes. This is scoped non-regression, not proof that every SVG has complete topology or ink certification. Current SVG structure has43 topology passes, one failure,71 unknowns and12 n/a; layout has90 passes, one failure,35 unknowns and one n/a.','','Named trade-offs remain. The `Start→Queue→Done` input with eight labelled Queue self-loops has two AM crossings and zero Mermaid crossings; Native refuses it. The Neovim/Node.js module example has zero AM edge/label intersections versus one observed in Mermaid. Exact inputs are retained in [drawing-inputs.json](drawing-inputs.json), keyed `drawing:90e78c1ed707e7e4` and `drawing:22e97a0fc1fff023`.','','The exact nine targeted stress/readability inputs are not in the canonical127 Drawing cases. Their earlier scoped evidence remains necessary: wallet now has three separately traceable upper arrivals, zero crossings and+16.52% wire; balanced seed135 changes13→8 crossings cumulatively, with+0.13% wire in its latest step. Cyclic19 remains AM37 / historical Native23 / ZM31 / hosted Pele40 / local Pele38. Seed139 remains AM24 / ZM17 / Pele21 and has two n16 marker/node potential-occlusion findings. The earlier scoped Trident observer cap on the difficult example was not raised or counted as a pass. Common peer glyph/paint clearance is not certified.','','## Fully consumed Node renders: whole PR versus main','','Three fresh processes per arm/case/cache; seven warm calls per process and three repeats after one actual edit. Each clock consumes SVG plus the entire receipt: receipt JSON serialization and separate actual UTF8 buffers for SVG and receipt. Import, cold, warm, first edit and edited repeats are separate. GC, output compression and evidence writes are outside API clocks. Medians below are medians of per-process means; paired ratios and every phase/replica are retained in [summary.json](consumed-qualified/summary.json). This is exploratory sampling, not formal calibration.','','This protocol differs from earlier whole-product JSON/UTF8-length probes; do not attribute absolute cross-protocol or cross-run time differences to code. The within-run main/PR comparison uses identical work. RSS/heap include the Node harness, import, retained products and prior evidence compression; no browser memory is mixed into these rows.','','All336 qualified processes yield4,032 products:3,552 own-certifier paint passes and480 unknowns, zero render/lifecycle errors. Main and current each have936 passes and72 unknowns, all current unknowns on seed139. Every Chain300 phase is passed in every arm (72 each), including main: no PR-specific proof restoration is claimed. Historical scopes/revisions differ and are not ranked by pass rate.','','The initial two Event edit sources were invalid (`cmd Save edit`). All four arms refused them identically:192 parse-error products remain in the original336-process run. Only those two controls were recovered using valid `cmd SaveEdit`; all eight public-parser checks accepted the corrected sources and48 fresh processes completed. The qualified population uses the original12 non-Event cases and those two recovered cases. Across all actual work,384 processes /4,608 products include3,936 passes,480 unknowns and192 invalid-edit refusals;384 original Event cold/warm returns are retained duplicate observations rather than extra success credit. [Derived population provenance](consumed-qualified/provenance.json).','','| Cache0 case | Main import ms | PR import ms | Main cold ms | PR cold ms | Main warm ms | PR warm ms | Main first edit ms | PR first edit ms |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
