lines+=['','### Same-host historical renderer controls','','Each cell below is warm ms / warm RSS MiB / warm heap MiB, cache0. These are complete AM public renders and receipts at different shared consumer revisions, not isolated ELK kernel measurements. The older Native’s different drawings, refusals and paint unknowns remain in raw evidence. No aggregate win from unequal behavior is claimed.','','| Case | Main ELK.ts | PR ELK.ts | ELK.js historical | Native historical |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
